content:
Bridge length alone:  
\[
L = 15 \times 1200 = 18000 \text{ m}
\]

Full crossing distance:  
\[
18000 + 600 = 18600 \text{ m}
\]

Time to cross:  
\[
\frac{18600}{15} = 1240 \text{ seconds}
\]

\[
1240 \text{ seconds} = 20 \text{ minutes } 40 \text{ seconds}
\]

\boxed{20 \text{ minutes } 40 \text{ seconds}}
